(2161,'theme_moove','marketingcontent','<blockquote>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Siri Vajiraramaya is arguably the best-known Sri Lankan Buddhist temple throughout the world due to the renowned resident monks who spread the teachings of the Buddha worldwide.</h3>\r\n</blockquote>'),
(2162,'theme_moove','marketing1icon','/icon-019-160x160.png'),
(2163,'theme_moove','marketing1heading','දැක්ම'),
(2164,'theme_moove','marketing1content','<p>“සුනාථ ධාරෙථ චරාථ ධමෙමෙ”</p>\r\n<p>(අසවු – දරවු- දම් හැසිරෙව් එදම්හි)</p>'),
